{"seq":1,"slug":"batching-performance","title":"批处理与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/practice/batching-performance","wordCount":1477,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"批处理与性能\">批处理与性能</h1><p>一个能画一万个精灵的 WebGL demo，第一版代码往往是「循环一万次，每次绑定、设 uniform、drawArrays」——然后帧率停在 15fps。问题不在 GPU 算不动，而在 CPU 每帧要向 GPU 驱动发起一万次绘制命令，每次都伴随状态切换和驱动开销。渲染性能优化的第一性原理只有一句话：<strong>减少 draw call</strong>。这篇文档讲清 draw call 为什么贵，以及合并几何、实例化、纹理图集、状态排序这四把削减它的利器，外加 Canvas 2D 一侧的对应手法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-draw-call-是头号敌人\">核心概念：draw call 是头号敌人</h2><p>一次 <code>drawArrays</code>/<code>drawElements</code> 就是一次 draw call——CPU 通过驱动向 GPU 提交一批绘制工作。回顾 <a href=\"../webgl/rendering-pipeline\">渲染管线</a> 里 WebGL 的状态机本质：每次 draw call 前通常要切换状态（绑缓冲、换纹理、设 uniform、换 program），这些切换加上驱动把命令翻译、校验、提交的固定开销，构成了每次 draw call 的「税」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[每帧渲染 N 个物体] --&gt; B{每物体一次 draw call?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是, N 次| C[N 次状态切换 + 驱动开销&lt;br/&gt;CPU 成为瓶颈]&#10;  B --&gt;|否, 批处理| D[合并几何/实例化&lt;br/&gt;压成 K 次 draw call, K&lt;&lt;N]&#10;  C --&gt; E[帧率被 CPU 拖垮]&#10;  D --&gt; F[GPU 吃满, 帧率达标]\">flowchart TD\n  A[每帧渲染 N 个物体] --&gt; B{每物体一次 draw call?}\n  B --&gt;|是, N 次| C[N 次状态切换 + 驱动开销&lt;br/&gt;CPU 成为瓶颈]\n  B --&gt;|否, 批处理| D[合并几何/实例化&lt;br/&gt;压成 K 次 draw call, K&lt;&lt;N]\n  C --&gt; E[帧率被 CPU 拖垮]\n  D --&gt; F[GPU 吃满, 帧率达标]</pre><p>关键洞察是：<strong>瓶颈常在 CPU 侧，不在 GPU 算力</strong>。GPU 一次画一百万个三角形毫不费力，但它讨厌被打断一万次。所以优化不是让 GPU 算得更少，而是让 CPU 少发命令、每条命令带更多工作。设每帧物体数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、单次 draw call 固定开销 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，未优化的 CPU 开销约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>；批处理后压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 次（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K \\ll N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>），开销降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K\\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。这就是所有批处理技术的共同数学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合并几何与实例化绘制\">合并几何与实例化绘制</h2><p>削减 draw call 有两条主路：把多个物体合并进一次绘制，或用实例化让 GPU 自己重复画。</p>\n<p><strong>合并几何（batching）</strong> 把多个共享同一材质（同 program、同纹理）的物体的顶点，打包进一个大 VBO，一次 <code>drawElements</code> 全画出来。代价是这些物体的变换要预先在 CPU 算好烘进顶点坐标，适合静态或整体变换的物体。</p>\n<p><strong>实例化绘制（instancing）</strong> 更优雅：几何只存一份，用一个「实例属性」数组提供每个实例各自的变换/颜色，GPU 用一条命令画出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 份。WebGL2 原生支持 <code>drawArraysInstanced</code>/<code>drawElementsInstanced</code>，配合 <code>vertexAttribDivisor</code> 指定「这个属性每个实例换一次，而非每个顶点换一次」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 每个实例的偏移量, 用 divisor 标记为逐实例&#10;gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, offsetBuffer);&#10;gl.vertexAttribPointer(offsetLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);&#10;gl.vertexAttribDivisor(offsetLoc, 1); // 1 = 每个实例前进一次&#10;gl.enableVertexAttribArray(offsetLoc);&#10;// 一条命令画一万个实例&#10;gl.drawArraysInstanced(gl.TRIANGLES, 0, 6, 10000);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每个实例的偏移量, 用 divisor 标记为逐实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bindBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ARRAY_BUFFER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offsetBuffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vertexAttribPointer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(offsetLoc, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FLOAT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vertexAttribDivisor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(offsetLoc, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1 = 每个实例前进一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enableVertexAttribArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(offsetLoc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 一条命令画一万个实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawArraysInstanced</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TRIANGLES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一万个精灵从一万次 draw call 压成一次——这是粒子系统、大规模散点图的标准解法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th align=\"center\">draw call</th>\n<th>灵活性</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逐物体绘制</td>\n<td>物体少、各异</td>\n<td align=\"center\">N 次</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>CPU 瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并几何</td>\n<td>静态、同材质</td>\n<td align=\"center\">1 次</td>\n<td>低（变换烘死）</td>\n<td>更新需重建缓冲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实例化</td>\n<td>大量同几何</td>\n<td align=\"center\">1 次</td>\n<td>中（逐实例属性）</td>\n<td>需 WebGL2/扩展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"纹理图集与状态排序\">纹理图集与状态排序</h2><p>即便用了实例化，不同物体用不同纹理仍会逼你切换纹理、拆分批次。两个手法进一步压缩：</p>\n<p><strong>纹理图集（texture atlas）</strong> 把许多小图拼进一张大纹理，物体通过不同的 UV 区间取用各自的图。这样一批用不同小图的精灵就能共享同一个纹理绑定，合进一次 draw call。图标、字体字形、瓦片地图几乎都用图集。</p>\n<p><strong>状态排序（state sorting）</strong> 针对无法合并的物体：按「切换成本」给渲染顺序排序，把用同一 program、同一纹理的物体排在一起连续绘制，最小化状态切换次数。切换 program 最贵，切换纹理次之，改 uniform 较便宜，所以排序优先级通常是 program &gt; texture &gt; uniform。VAO（见 <a href=\"../webgl/buffers-textures\">缓冲与纹理</a>）让每次状态恢复只需一行，是状态排序的好搭档。</p>\n<p>排序能省多少，取决于切换的分布。若有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个物体、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 种 program，随机顺序下平均切换次数接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，理想排序后降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx N - P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>。物体越多、材质种类越少，排序越划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"canvas-2d-一侧的性能手法\">Canvas 2D 一侧的性能手法</h2><p>批处理思想在 Canvas 2D 里有对应版本，虽然它没有显式 draw call 概念，但同样怕「重复劳动」：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分层画布</strong>：把静态背景和动态前景拆成两块叠放的 <code>&lt;canvas&gt;</code>，静态层只画一次，每帧只重绘动态层，避免整屏重画。</li>\n<li><strong>脏矩形（dirty rectangle）</strong>：只 <code>clearRect</code> + 重绘发生变化的小区域，而非整块画布。</li>\n<li><strong>离屏缓存</strong>：把反复绘制的复杂图形（如一个精细图标）先画进一个离屏 <code>&lt;canvas&gt;</code>，之后每帧用 <code>drawImage</code> 贴过来，把「重新执行几十条路径命令」换成「一次位图拷贝」，这与 <a href=\"../canvas2d/paths-shapes\">路径与形状</a> 里 <code>Path2D</code> 的缓存思想一脉相承。</li>\n<li><strong>避免高频 <code>getImageData</code></strong>：如前述，它触发 GPU 回读，见 <a href=\"../canvas2d/images-pixels\">位图与像素操作</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无论哪套 API，度量都要先行——用 Chrome Performance 面板和 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 里的 <code>performance.now()</code> 找出到底是 CPU 提交瓶颈还是 GPU 填充瓶颈，再对症下药。帧预算与掉帧的度量体系见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/foundations/performance-model\">Web 性能与核心指标 · 性能模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>渲染优化第一性原理是减少 draw call：瓶颈常在 CPU 每帧向驱动提交命令与状态切换的固定开销，而非 GPU 算力；未优化开销约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，批处理后降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K\\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K\\ll N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>合并几何把同材质物体打进一个 VBO 一次画完（适合静态）；实例化用 <code>drawArraysInstanced</code> + <code>vertexAttribDivisor</code> 让几何存一份、GPU 画 N 份（适合大量同几何，如粒子）。</li>\n<li>纹理图集把小图拼成一张大纹理以共享绑定；状态排序按 program &gt; texture &gt; uniform 的切换成本排序绘制，物体多、材质少时收益最大。</li>\n<li>Canvas 2D 对应手法是分层画布、脏矩形、离屏缓存、避免高频 <code>getImageData</code>；任何优化前先用性能面板定位是 CPU 还是 GPU 瓶颈。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：draw call 与状态机的由来见 <a href=\"../webgl/rendering-pipeline\">渲染管线</a>；VAO 如何配合状态排序见 <a href=\"../webgl/buffers-textures\">缓冲与纹理</a>；把渲染搬离主线程见 <a href=\"offscreen-workers\">离屏渲染与 Worker</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：帧预算与性能度量见 <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/foundations/performance-model\">Web 性能与核心指标 · 性能模型</a>；动画流畅度的 60fps 约束见 <a href=\"../../web-animation/foundations/rendering-pipeline-and-60fps\">Web 动画 · 渲染管线与 60fps</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"批处理与性能","id":"批处理与性能"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：draw call 是头号敌人","id":"核心概念-draw-call-是头号敌人"},{"level":2,"text":"合并几何与实例化绘制","id":"合并几何与实例化绘制"},{"level":2,"text":"纹理图集与状态排序","id":"纹理图集与状态排序"},{"level":2,"text":"Canvas 2D 一侧的性能手法","id":"canvas-2d-一侧的性能手法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"缓冲与纹理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/webgl/buffers-textures"},"next":{"title":"离屏渲染与 Worker","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/practice/offscreen-workers"}}